{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>中環有拉麵店推出「黑芝麻秋園泡沫雞白湯拉麵」。端上枱時原本是乳白色、口感偏清爽的泡沫雞白湯，但碗中放有一大球如雪糕球般的黑芝麻醬，用筷子輕輕拌開後，整碗湯底隨即化作水泥色，視覺衝擊感滿分！\n</p>\n<p>編輯的話：這間拉麵舖的恆常Menu不是我杯茶，但過往期間限定的蠔拉麵、粟米拉麵，這次的黑芝麻拉麵，一些較特別的口味都不錯吃～</p>\n<p>㊙️獵奇指數：🩵🩵<br/>\n🫀勇氣指數：🩵🩵</p>\n<p>🩵留言「吓芝麻」Send拉麵詳細資料給你～</p>\n<p>為食出走 ｜ 用味蕾探索世界，由地道小食到追求極致的星級餐廳，每一啖都品嚐著每個城市最獨特的風味。哪一道美食令你念念不忘？即刻DM我哋分享你的為食出走經歷！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326087551622788_8675270736ae2fd4c9b668.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326087551622788_8675270736ae2fd4c9b668.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：GOtrip編輯部)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfEPX4Rzs_2/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IG精選</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%b8%ad%e7%92%b0%e6%8b%89%e9%ba%b5/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">中環拉麵</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%8d%b5%e5%a5%87%e9%a4%90%e6%a1%8c/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">獵奇餐桌</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%bb%91%e8%8a%9d%e9%ba%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">黑芝麻</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：GOtrip編輯部資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfEPX4Rzs_2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gotrip IG</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nOct 29 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T08:21:52.062419+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":427,"images":1,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T08:01:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T10:18:44.322412+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T08:18:38.471893+00:00","content_hash":"2229ce04ffa96f08a1e18e80b166268e2c2cde2e31b6fc4e3d5327901c998983","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}